  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2219,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce096:008C9",
  "jp": "オーレリィ「‥‥今、ガボンを呼びに行ってるよ。{nl}　‥‥まったく。いきなり倒れてピクリともしなくなるし、{nl}　こっちは本気で心配したんだから」",
  "off": 2249,
  "len": 85,
  "en": "Aurelie: ...She went to get Gabon. ...Honestly. You just keel over and don't even twitch. I was seriously worried, y'know.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2251,
  "text_len": 82
 },
 {
  "id": "sce096:00921",
  "jp": "トウヤ「すまねぇ‥‥逆に心配させちまって‥‥{nl}　ざまぁねぇよな」",
  "off": 2337,
  "len": 42,
  "en": "Touya: Sorry... I ended up being the one who worried you... Pathetic, huh.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2339,
  "text_len": 39
 },
 {
  "id": "sce096:0094E",
